All responses are returning the same body (content-length 216) regardless of pagination parameters. It appears the API returns all legs for voy-5501 in a single response. The body preview consistently shows:

```json
{
  "legs": [
    {"leg_id": "leg-7c2e-3301", "voyage_id": "voy-5501", "from_port": "RTM", "to_port": "SIN", "distance_nm": 8412},
    {"leg_id": "leg-7c2e-3302", "voyage_id": "voy-5501", "from_port": "SIN", "to_port": "SHA", "distance_nm": 2238}
  ]
}
```

The final hop into SHA (Shanghai) is the leg terminating at SHA. That's leg-7c2e-3302, with distance_nm 2238.

Let me also try to get the full body by reading a response entity. The issue might be that `read` with the response ref is failing. Let me try searching more specifically.
